===Etymology===
From Old Galician and {{inh|gl|roa-opt|perigo}}, {{m|roa-opt|perigoo}} (13th century, ''{{w|Cantigas de Santa Maria}}''), probably a semi-learned evolution of {{der|gl|la|perīculum||danger}}.

